title: "beaverbridge-registry: Registry of static Wikibase instances"
abstract: >-
  Harvests RDF exports of static Wikibase instances, bundles them into a DCAT catalogue anchored in CIDOC CRM and publishes a facet page and a browser SPARQL page.
